          <p class="muted">An unhurried conversation about what you would like to change and why. Dr. Junaid examines you, reviews your medical history and explains:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>which options suit you, including non-surgical ones</li>
            <li>what result is realistic, and what is not</li>
            <li>the risks, the recovery and the time you will need off work</li>
